/Title (Could Seed's debut album, "The Drop Crisis," gathers the beloved themes of its members, borrowing here and there stoner with Elder flavour, post-rock from Caspian, a psychedelic madness, or a math-rock explosion... all wrapped in a sound that's both sturdy and delicate. Each track takes the listener by the hand, guiding them on a journey that warms both heart and mind, serving as a foundation for a trance built on myths and daydreams.)
